{"seq":3,"slug":"prevention-practices","title":"预防实践：让质量要求成为工程默认值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/management/prevention-practices","wordCount":830,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"预防实践-让质量要求成为工程默认值\">预防实践：让质量要求成为工程默认值</h1><p>债务偿还是必要的，但如果没有预防机制，债务会在下一个开发周期重新积累。技术债预防的核心思路是<strong>将质量要求编码为工程系统的默认行为</strong>——不依赖工程师的个人自律，而是通过自动化工具链、架构约束、代码规范和团队实践，让「高质量」成为阻力最小的路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-预防层级\">核心概念：预防层级</h2><p>技术债预防有四个层级，层级越低越靠近开发者，反馈越即时：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[L4: 组织实践\\n Tech Health Review\\n季度债务复盘] --&gt; B[L3: 架构守护\\n 适应度函数\\nCI 架构测试]&#10;    B --&gt; C[L2: CI 质量门\\n 静态分析\\n 测试覆盖率]&#10;    C --&gt; D[L1: 本地工具\\n Pre-commit Hooks\\n IDE 实时反馈]\">flowchart TD\n    A[L4: 组织实践\\n Tech Health Review\\n季度债务复盘] --&gt; B[L3: 架构守护\\n 适应度函数\\nCI 架构测试]\n    B --&gt; C[L2: CI 质量门\\n 静态分析\\n 测试覆盖率]\n    C --&gt; D[L1: 本地工具\\n Pre-commit Hooks\\n IDE 实时反馈]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预防层级</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>反馈延迟</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1：本地工具</td>\n<td>代码提交前（本地）</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>单个文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2：CI 质量门</td>\n<td>PR 合并前</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>整个 PR 变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3：架构守护</td>\n<td>PR 合并时或定期</td>\n<td>分钟到小时</td>\n<td>整个代码库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4：组织实践</td>\n<td>每月/季度</td>\n<td>天到周</td>\n<td>整个工程组织</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"pre-commit-hooks-最低成本的质量门\">Pre-commit Hooks：最低成本的质量门</h2><p>Pre-commit hooks 在代码提交到仓库前运行，能捕捉大量低级别的质量问题，且反馈即时：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .pre-commit-config.yaml 示例（Python + JavaScript 混合项目）&#10;repos:&#10;  - repo: https://github.com/pre-commit/pre-commit-hooks&#10;    rev: v4.5.0&#10;    hooks:&#10;      - id: trailing-whitespace&#10;      - id: end-of-file-fixer&#10;      - id: check-merge-conflict&#10;      - id: check-added-large-files&#10;        args: [&#39;--maxkb=500&#39;]&#10;&#10;  - repo: https://github.com/psf/black&#10;    rev: 23.12.0&#10;    hooks:&#10;      - id: black  # Python 代码格式化&#10;&#10;  - repo: https://github.com/pycqa/flake8&#10;    rev: 7.0.0&#10;    hooks:&#10;      - id: flake8  # Python 代码检查&#10;        args: [&#39;--max-complexity=10&#39;, &#39;--max-line-length=88&#39;]&#10;&#10;  # JavaScript/TypeScript&#10;  - repo: local&#10;    hooks:&#10;      - id: eslint&#10;        name: ESLint&#10;        entry: npx eslint --fix&#10;        language: node&#10;        types: [javascript, typescript]&#10;      - id: type-check&#10;        name: TypeScript Type Check&#10;        entry: npx tsc --noEmit&#10;        language: node&#10;        pass_filenames: false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .pre-commit-config.yaml 示例（Python + JavaScript 混合项目）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">repos:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/pre-commit/pre-commit-hooks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    rev:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v4.5.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    hooks:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> id:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> trailing-whitespace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> id:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> end-of-file-fixer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> id:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check-merge-conflict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> id:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check-added-large-files</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        args:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'--maxkb=500'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/psf/black</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    rev:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 23.12.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    hooks:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> id:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> black</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # Python 代码格式化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/pycqa/flake8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    rev:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    hooks:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> id:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flake8</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # Python 代码检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        args:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'--max-complexity=10'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'--max-line-length=88']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # JavaScript/TypeScript</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> local</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    hooks:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> id:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eslint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ESLint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        entry:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eslint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --fix</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        language:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        types:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [javascript, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">typescript]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      -</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> id:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> type-check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        name:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> TypeScript</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        entry:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tsc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --noEmit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        language:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        pass_filenames:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Pre-commit hooks 选择原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每次运行时间 &lt; 30 秒（否则工程师会绕过）</li>\n<li>自动修复（--fix）优先于只报告</li>\n<li>失败时给出明确的修复指引，而不只是错误码</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ci-质量门-合并前的强制检查\">CI 质量门：合并前的强制检查</h2><p>CI 质量门是技术债预防的第二道防线，在 PR 合并前强制执行质量标准：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions 质量门示例&#10;name: Quality Gate&#10;on: [pull_request]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  sonarqube-analysis:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0 # 需要完整 git 历史&#10;&#10;      - name: SonarQube Scan&#10;        uses: SonarSource/sonarqube-scan-action@master&#10;        env:&#10;          SONAR_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.SONAR_TOKEN }}&#10;          SONAR_HOST_URL: ${{ secrets.SONAR_HOST_URL }}&#10;&#10;      - name: Quality Gate Check&#10;        uses: SonarSource/sonarqube-quality-gate-action@master&#10;        timeout-minutes: 5&#10;        env:&#10;          SONAR_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.SONAR_TOKEN }}&#10;        # 失败条件（sonar-project.properties 中配置）：&#10;        # sonar.qualitygate.wait=true&#10;        # 覆盖率下降 &gt; 2%&#10;        # 新代码技术债比率 &gt; 5%&#10;        # 新代码认知复杂度 &gt; 15\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions 质量门示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Quality Gate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  sonarqube-analysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 需要完整 git 历史</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SonarQube Scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SonarSource/sonarqube-scan-action@master</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          SONAR_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.SONAR_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          SONAR_HOST_URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.SONAR_HOST_URL }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Quality Gate Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SonarSource/sonarqube-quality-gate-action@master</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        timeout-minutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          SONAR_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.SONAR_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 失败条件（sonar-project.properties 中配置）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # sonar.qualitygate.wait=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 覆盖率下降 > 2%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 新代码技术债比率 > 5%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 新代码认知复杂度 > 15</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>质量门阈值设置建议</strong>（针对新代码，而不是全部代码）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>建议阈值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>覆盖率（新代码）</td>\n<td>≥ 80%</td>\n<td>防止测试债增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复率（新代码）</td>\n<td>&lt; 3%</td>\n<td>防止重复代码引入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认知复杂度（新函数）</td>\n<td>≤ 15</td>\n<td>防止难以维护的函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全热点</td>\n<td>0 个未审查</td>\n<td>所有安全问题必须有人确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新增 Bug</td>\n<td>0 个</td>\n<td>不允许已知 Bug 合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键实践</strong>：质量门应该针对<strong>新代码</strong>，而不是全部代码。要求新 PR 满足全库旧标准会导致工程师绕过或放弃，而要求新代码达到更高标准是可行的增量改善路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"架构决策记录-adr-将权衡文档化\">架构决策记录（ADR）：将权衡文档化</h2><p>Architecture Decision Records（ADR）是防止「遗忘的债务」的关键工具。每次做出可能产生技术债的架构决策时，用 ADR 记录决策背景、权衡和还款计划：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# ADR-042: 暂时使用单库事务代替分布式 Saga&#10;&#10;## 状态&#10;&#10;已接受（2026-03-15）| 计划在 Q3 2026 复查&#10;&#10;## 背景&#10;&#10;订单服务需要在 Sprint 23 前上线以支持大促。实现 Saga 模式需要额外 3 个 Sprint 的工时，&#10;当前时间窗口无法支持。&#10;&#10;## 决策&#10;&#10;暂时使用跨库事务处理订单创建流程。&#10;&#10;## 技术债评估&#10;&#10;- 本金：实现完整 Saga 模式估计 180 工程小时&#10;- 利息：每次新增业务流程需要额外 8-12 小时处理事务边界&#10;- 可接受条件：订单日峰值 &lt; 50,000，否则可能出现锁争用&#10;&#10;## 还款计划&#10;&#10;- 触发条件：日订单量超过 30,000 或 Q3 2026 大促后 Sprint 1&#10;- 负责人：订单团队 Tech Lead&#10;- 预计工时：180 小时（3 个 Sprint 的 20% 时间）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># ADR-042: 暂时使用单库事务代替分布式 Saga</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">已接受（2026-03-15）| 计划在 Q3 2026 复查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 背景</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">订单服务需要在 Sprint 23 前上线以支持大促。实现 Saga 模式需要额外 3 个 Sprint 的工时，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">当前时间窗口无法支持。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 决策</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">暂时使用跨库事务处理订单创建流程。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 技术债评估</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 本金：实现完整 Saga 模式估计 180 工程小时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 利息：每次新增业务流程需要额外 8-12 小时处理事务边界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 可接受条件：订单日峰值 &#x3C; 50,000，否则可能出现锁争用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 还款计划</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 触发条件：日订单量超过 30,000 或 Q3 2026 大促后 Sprint 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 负责人：订单团队 Tech Lead</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 预计工时：180 小时（3 个 Sprint 的 20% 时间）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"linting-作为质量护栏\">Linting 作为质量护栏</h2><p>除了 SonarQube，项目专属的 linting 规则是防止特定类型债务的精准工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// .eslintrc.js - 针对项目历史问题的定制规则&#10;module.exports = {&#10;  rules: {&#10;    // 禁止直接修改外部状态（历史问题：Redux 状态直接突变）&#10;    &#39;no-param-reassign&#39;: [&#39;error&#39;, { props: true }],&#10;&#10;    // 限制函数复杂度（历史问题：大函数积累）&#10;    complexity: [&#39;error&#39;, { max: 10 }],&#10;    &#39;max-lines-per-function&#39;: [&#39;warn&#39;, { max: 50 }],&#10;&#10;    // 禁止特定的反模式（历史问题：console.log 留在生产代码）&#10;    &#39;no-console&#39;: &#39;error&#39;,&#10;&#10;    // 强制使用项目统一的错误处理工具&#10;    &#39;no-throw-literal&#39;: &#39;error&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .eslintrc.js - 针对项目历史问题的定制规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exports</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 禁止直接修改外部状态（历史问题：Redux 状态直接突变）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'no-param-reassign'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { props: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 限制函数复杂度（历史问题：大函数积累）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    complexity: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { max: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'max-lines-per-function'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { max: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 禁止特定的反模式（历史问题：console.log 留在生产代码）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'no-console'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 强制使用项目统一的错误处理工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'no-throw-literal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>技术债预防有四个层级（本地工具→CI 质量门→架构守护→组织实践），层级越低反馈越即时，成本越低</li>\n<li>Pre-commit hooks 是成本最低的预防措施，每次提交前运行，30 秒内完成，自动修复优先</li>\n<li>CI 质量门应该针对<strong>新代码</strong>设置更高标准（而非全库旧代码），是增量改善而非「全部修好才能合并」</li>\n<li>ADR 将有意识的技术债权衡文档化，包含还款计划和触发条件，防止债务被遗忘</li>\n<li>将常见问题编码为 linting 规则，比依赖代码审查更可靠，因为工具规则不会因为赶时间而被跳过</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预防实践：让质量要求成为工程默认值","id":"预防实践-让质量要求成为工程默认值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：预防层级","id":"核心概念-预防层级"},{"level":2,"text":"Pre-commit Hooks：最低成本的质量门","id":"pre-commit-hooks-最低成本的质量门"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 质量门：合并前的强制检查","id":"ci-质量门-合并前的强制检查"},{"level":2,"text":"架构决策记录（ADR）：将权衡文档化","id":"架构决策记录-adr-将权衡文档化"},{"level":2,"text":"Linting 作为质量护栏","id":"linting-作为质量护栏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"重构预算与偿还策略：20% 时间与 Boy Scout Rule","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/management/refactoring-budget"},"next":{"title":"债务登记与追踪：技术债的可见性工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/organization/debt-registry-tracking"}}